    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert insurance claims analyst with fraud detection expertise. Analyze the following accident report and provide a comprehensive 2-page summary (approximately 1000 words) in English.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** If the document is in Hindi, Urdu, or any regional language, translate it to English while maintaining accuracy.\n\n**LIABILITY ANALYSIS:**\n- Determination of fault and contributing factors\n- Evidence supporting liability assessment\n- Applicable laws and regulations\n- Comparative negligence considerations\n- Liability percentage recommendations\n\n**DAMAGES ASSESSMENT:**\n- Property damage details and estimated costs\n- Bodily injuries and medical treatment\n- Lost wages and economic losses\n- Pain and suffering considerations\n- Total damages valuation\n\n**FRAUD DETECTION - RED FLAGS:**\nCarefully examine and flag any suspicious indicators:\n- Inconsistent dates or timelines (e.g., treatment before accident, conflicting incident dates)\n- Contradictory statements or details between parties\n- Unusual patterns (e.g., multiple claims, pre-existing damage claims)\n- Missing or vague critical information\n- Exaggerated injury claims vs. accident severity\n- Delayed reporting without valid explanation\n- Witness credibility issues\n- Document authenticity concerns\n\nAlso include brief context on parties involved, date/time/location, and incident description.\n\n**Format your response with clear sections and list any RED FLAGS prominently.**\n\nAccident Report:\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional insurance claims analyst specializing in liability determination, damages assessment, and fraud detection. Always provide summaries in English, translating from other languages when necessary.",
          "maxIterations": 5
        }
      },
      "id": "7dd27f9e-8b21-49af-8f0f-c3bebc3ad4f8",
      "name": "Summarize Accident Report",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
